a Clara Jensen","subject":"Service disruption affecting Payments API, Payouts, Webhooks","body":"Hello Bluepeak Travel team,\n\nSince 07:00 UTC on 9 October 2026 some requests to Payments API, Payouts, Webhooks have been failing. We have identified the cause and are rolling out a fix.\n\nOn 20 August 2026 we told you: \"We will notify Bluepeak within 15 minutes of any incident that affects the Payments API.\" We have not met that, and Clara Jensen will call you directly.\n\nYour agreement CON-2026-021 guarantees 99.95% uptime. If this month falls below it, the 10% service credit will be applied without you needing to ask.\n\nReference: INC-104\nClara Jensen","status":"proposed","proposed_at":"2026-10-31T22:40:22Z","refs":["Finding:INV-104:F:commitment:COM-bluepeak-notify-15","Finding:INV-104:F:sla:all"]},{"id":"INV-104:A:customer_notice:kite","kind":"customer_notice","to":"Kite Grocers","channel":"email via Nikhil Shah","subject":"Service disruption affecting Hosted Checkout, Payouts","body":"Hello Kite Grocers team,\n\nSince 07:00 UTC on 9 October 2026 some requests to Hosted Checkout, Payouts have been failing. We have identified the cause and are rolling out a fix.\n\nYour agreement CON-2025-077 guarantees 99.9% uptime. If this month falls below it, the 5% service credit will be applied without you needing to ask.\n\nReference: INC-104\nNikhil Shah","status":"proposed","proposed_at":"2026-10-31T22:40:22Z","refs":["Finding:INV-104:F:sla:all"]},{"id":"INV-104:A:customer_notice:larkspur","kind":"customer_notice","to":"Larkspur Retail","channel":"email via Nikhil Shah","subject":"Service disruption affecting Payments API, Hosted Checkout, Webhooks","body":"Hello Larkspur Retail team,\n\nSince 07:00 UTC on 9 October 2026 some requests to Payments API, Hosted Checkout, Webhooks have been failing. We have identified the cause and are rolling out a fix.\n\nYour agreement CON-2026-014 guarantees 99.95% uptime. If this month falls below it, the 10% service credit will be applied without you needing to ask.\n\nReference: INC-104\nNikhil Shah","status":"proposed","proposed_at":"2026-10-31T22:40:22Z","refs":["Finding:INV-104:F:sla:all"]},{"id":"INV-104:A:page:asha","kind":"page","to":"Asha Rao","channel":"pager","subject":"[INC-104] webhooks-service 5xx rate 22% over 5m","body":"Asha Rao, you are on call for payments-core.\n\nINC-104: webhooks-service 5xx rate 22% over 5m\nLikely cause: Lower fraud-scorer client pool to 5 (PR-421) in payments-core.\nThe evidence and what Ripple proposes are waiting for your review in the incident room.","status":"proposed","proposed_at":"2026-10-31T22:40:22Z","refs":["Finding:INV-104:F:root_cause:root"]},{"id":"INV-104:A:status_page:public","kind":"status_page","to":"Status page","channel":"status page","subject":"Investigating degraded performance: Hosted Checkout, Payments API, Payouts, Webhooks","body":"We are investigating elevated error rates affecting Hosted Checkout, Payments API, Payouts, Webhooks. A cause has been identified and a fix is being rolled out. Next update in 30 minutes. Reference INC-104.","status":"proposed","proposed_at":"2026-10-31T22:40:22Z","refs":["Finding:INV-104:F:customers:all"]}],"remediations":[],"canvas":{"nodes":[{"kind":"Incident","id":"INC-088","name":"ledger-db ran out of connections","first_seq":1},{"kind":"Service","id":"ledger-db","name":"ledger-db","first_seq":1},{"kind":"Service","id":"payments-core","name":"payments-core","first_seq":1},{"kind":"PR","id":"PR-377","name":"Retry ledger writes without backoff","first_seq":1},{"kind":"PR","id":"PR-301","name":"Scale payouts workers to 12 replicas","first_seq":1},{"kind":"PR","id":"PR-380","name":"Add exponential backoff to ledger retries","first_seq":1},{"kind":"Incident","id":"INC-101","name":"Payments timeouts from a ledger retry storm","first_seq":1},{"kind":"Investigation","id":"INV-102","name":"INV-102","first_seq":2},{"kind":"Playbook","id":"PB-INV-102","name":"PB-INV-102","first_seq":2},{"kind":"Fact","id":"